# 2. FEATURE OBJECTIVE

Add a configurable **Daily Goals** feature with two independent goals:

### Goal A — Daily New Intake

The user sets a target for the number of distinct new vocabulary words to learn per local calendar day.

Only genuinely new words completed through the existing New Intake learning flow count toward this goal.

### Goal B — Daily Weak Words Practice

The user sets a target for the number of distinct weak vocabulary words practised per local calendar day.

Only qualifying words practised through the existing Weak Words practice flow count toward this goal.

### Streak rule

The daily study streak increases by exactly one day when, and only when, both daily goals have been satisfied on the same local calendar day.

Opening the app, opening a word, revealing an answer, or completing only one of the two goals must not award the daily streak.

The feature must work across multiple study sessions during the same day and persist across page refreshes.

