## Final acceptance criterion

The implementation is accepted only when the user can configure two separate daily targets, accumulate distinct qualifying words across sessions, see accurate live progress, adjust the Weak Words target when the pool is insufficient, and earn at most one daily streak credit after both goals are complete on the same local calendar day—without disrupting existing learning data or core functionality.